            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Inventory for 1 MJ heat from pellets, burned in a cogeneration unit with a capacity of 50 kWth. The multioutput process "pellets, burned in cogen 50kWth delivers the coproducts "heat, at cogen 50kWth, pellets, allocation exergy" and "electricity, at cogen 50kWth, pellets, allocation exergy". The energy efficiency is 26% for electricity and 65% for heat. The economic factor is 0.77 for electricity and 0.23 for heat. This leads to the allocation factor of 0.58 for electricity and 0.42 for heat.</common:generalComment>
